## Steps
1. Inspect `.brain/memory.db` via `sqlite3` CLI or node one-liner (better-sqlite3 already rebuilt in system)
2. Query schema_version, entries counts by type, FTS5 table structure, relations integrity
3. Run `searchMemory` test via node dist/ or directly on DB:
